  "body": "When passing an `signal: AbortSignal` to the fetch method we register an `'abort'` listener through the `new Request` constructor (i.e. following signal). However, the spec does not define when and where this listener should be released in order to not cause leaks in the user provided signal.\r\n\r\nRefs: https://github.com/nodejs/undici/blob/0badd390ad5aa531a66aacee54da664468aa1577/lib/api/api-fetch/request.js#L280-L295",
